    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Take control</strong> of the <strong>US economy</strong> as you <strong>travel through time</strong> trying to rein in unemployment &amp; inflation. <br>Can you do better than the US Federal Reserve has done in the past?<br><br><strong>Characters</strong> from different time periods need your help. Accomplish their missions and you\u2019ll earn points and virtual dollars. Earn enough points to unlock access to the next time period. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/a3729b24b42306553a8ef0156c084a8b.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=306 /></span><br><br><strong>Invest</strong> your earnings based on what you know about historical events and monetary policy, which you control. Master stock and bond trading in challenging market conditions.  Will you get in before the masses or lose it all in a crash? <br><br>Use your fortune to <strong>customize your avatar</strong> and move up the Leaderboards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/1f8c514907d373e1dcfdef126d6bb22e.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=320 /></span><br><br>Bill Ockham, an inventor and economist from the future, has loaned you his <strong>time machine</strong> to travel to the Great Depression, the Dot Com era, the 2008 Housing Crash, and other exciting periods in US economic history. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/3341b25b9466a2a73d4f953142d70244.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=308 /></span><br><br>Do you have what it takes to <strong>Beat the Fed</strong>?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Take control</strong> of the <strong>US economy</strong> as you <strong>travel through time</strong> trying to rein in unemployment &amp; inflation. <br>Can you do better than the US Federal Reserve has done in the past?<br><br><strong>Characters</strong> from different time periods need your help. Accomplish their missions and you\u2019ll earn points and virtual dollars. Earn enough points to unlock access to the next time period. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/a3729b24b42306553a8ef0156c084a8b.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=306 /></span><br><br><strong>Invest</strong> your earnings based on what you know about historical events and monetary policy, which you control. Master stock and bond trading in challenging market conditions.  Will you get in before the masses or lose it all in a crash? <br><br>Use your fortune to <strong>customize your avatar</strong> and move up the Leaderboards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/1f8c514907d373e1dcfdef126d6bb22e.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=320 /></span><br><br>Bill Ockham, an inventor and economist from the future, has loaned you his <strong>time machine</strong> to travel to the Great Depression, the Dot Com era, the 2008 Housing Crash, and other exciting periods in US economic history. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888350/extras/3341b25b9466a2a73d4f953142d70244.avif?t=1738170371\" width=550 height=308 /></span><br><br>Do you have what it takes to <strong>Beat the Fed</strong>?",
